2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/NeedAppearances true
/Title (Remarks\040on\040the\040Cauchy\040functional\040equation\040and\040variations\040of\040it)
/Author (Daniel\040Reem)
/Subject (This\040paper\040examines\040various\040aspects\040related\040to\040the\040Cauchy\040functional\040equation\040\134\050f\050x\053y\051\075f\050x\051\053f\050y\051\134\051\054\040a\040fundamental\040equation\040in\040the\040theory\040of\040functional\040equations\056\040In\040particular\054\040it\040considers\040its\040solvability\040and\040its\040stability\040relative\040to\040subsets\040of\040multi\055dimensional\040Euclidean\040spaces\040and\040tori\056\040Several\040new\040types\040of\040regularity\040conditions\040are\040introduced\054\040such\040as\040one\040in\040which\040a\040complex\040exponent\040of\040the\040unknown\040function\040is\040locally\040measurable\056\040An\040initial\040value\040approach\040to\040analyzing\040this\040equation\040is\040considered\040too\040and\040it\040yields\040a\040few\040by\055products\054\040such\040as\040the\040existence\040of\040a\040non\055constant\040real\040function\040having\040an\040uncountable\040set\040of\040periods\040which\040are\040linearly\040independent\040over\040the\040rationals\056\040The\040analysis\040is\040extended\040to\040related\040equations\040such\040as\040the\040Jensen\040equation\054\040the\040multiplicative\040Cauchy\040equation\054\040and\040the\040Pexider\040equation\056\040The\040paper\040also\040includes\040a\040rather\040comprehensive\040survey\040of\040the\040history\040of\040the\040Cauchy\040equation\056)
/Keywords (07\040Feb\0402017\054\040Aequationes\040Mathematicae\054\040Cauchy\047s\040equation\054\040Initial\040value\040problem\054\040Function\040\050mathematics\051\054\040Multiplicative\040function\054\040Real\055valued\040function\054\040Technion\040\205\040Israel\040Institute\040of\040Technology)
>>
endobj
